option.VHS_4_3=4:3 Playback Frame
option.VHS_4_3.comment=Crops the central camera image into an authentic 4:3 tape frame with side borders.
option.ROUNDED_OVERSCAN=Rounded Overscan
option.ROUNDED_OVERSCAN.comment=Adds soft rounded playback edges and hides unstable outer picture areas.
option.VHS_OSD=VCR On-Screen Display
option.VHS_OSD.comment=Draws PLAY, transport, SLP, and an occasional tracking calibration overlay.
option.TAPE_SOFTNESS=Tape Softness
option.TAPE_SOFTNESS.comment=Removes fine luma detail like a low-bandwidth VHS recording.
option.CHROMA_BLEED=Chroma Bleed
option.CHROMA_BLEED.comment=Spreads low-resolution color horizontally while retaining somewhat sharper luminance.
option.BLACK_CRUSH=Black Crush
option.BLACK_CRUSH.comment=Recreates weak shadow response from a multi-generation or poorly exposed tape.
option.COLOR_SATURATION=Decoder Saturation
option.COLOR_SATURATION.comment=Controls the oversaturated green-heavy color decoder response.
option.HEAD_SWITCHING=Head-Switch Noise
option.HEAD_SWITCHING.comment=Controls unstable horizontal tearing and noise along the bottom of the frame.
option.HALATION_STRENGTH=Fluorescent Halation
option.HALATION_STRENGTH.comment=Adds soft sensor and tape glow around clipped lights without using modern cinematic bloom.
option.LUMA_RINGING=Luma Edge Ringing
option.LUMA_RINGING.comment=Adds bright and dark horizontal edge echoes from a cheap VCR sharpening circuit.
